  "description": "The Summit Plus is built for riders who need comfort, versatility, and dependable range in one foldable electric bike. Whether you're commuting through the city, carrying daily gear, making deliveries, or heading out for a weekend adventure, Summit Plus adapts to the way you ride.\nIts full suspension system and 20\" x 4.0\" fat tires help smooth out rough roads, gravel paths, and uneven terrain, while the powerful motor and long-range battery provide the confidence to go farther. When the ride is over, the folding frame makes storage and transport simple, whether at home, in the office, or loaded into your vehicle for the next trip.\nFrom everyday errands to outdoor exploration, Summit Plus is designed to make every mile more comfortable and capable.",
